    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/3e6c67cf986a0906c8e14bfb1f79d0c9.poster.avif?t=1750801146\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/3e6c67cf986a0906c8e14bfb1f79d0c9.webm?t=1750801146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/3e6c67cf986a0906c8e14bfb1f79d0c9.mp4?t=1750801146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 THE LEGEND RETURNS 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/2ee73f7a973bfeb71a30ca0a52630bbf.avif?t=1750801146\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight marks the anniversary. The day\u00a0<strong>he</strong>\u00a0returns. The news calls it a myth\u2014a story to scare people into locking their doors. But you don\u2019t believe in urban legends\u2026 until you see him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a normal night out quickly turns into a nightmare. A vagabond warns you:\u00a0<strong>no one walks these streets anymore.</strong>\u00a0A stranger whispers,\u00a0<strong>be careful.</strong>\u00a0Then, from the shadows,\u00a0<strong>he</strong>\u00a0watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you return home, strange things begin to happen.\u00a0<strong>Footsteps in the dark. A figure outside your window.</strong>\u00a0You\u2019re being hunted, and no one believes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No one\u2026 except one Strange Person.</strong>\u00a0Together, you search for answers, but the deeper you dig, the worse it gets. An ancient ritual is the only way to stop him. A single weapon\u2014the only thing that can end him for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you\u00a0<strong>run</strong>,\u00a0<strong>hide</strong>, or\u00a0<strong>fight</strong>? No one escapes the legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/a876b0077d487a8f0cce68ceee84a364.avif?t=1750801146\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udd2a <strong>A slasher horror game inspired by PS1 classics.</strong> Immerse yourself in a chilling atmosphere with retro graphics, eerie ambient sounds, and a story that will keep you on edge.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Gore-heavy cinematics with brutal encounters.</strong> There\u2019s no easy escape. Every encounter is a fight for survival, with gruesome deaths and intense sequences.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udc40 <strong>A relentless killer who always finds you.</strong> No matter where you hide or how fast you run, <strong>he</strong> is always near, lurking in the shadows.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Perform the ritual\u2026 or become the next victim.</strong> The only way to stop him is to uncover the secrets behind the legend and complete the ancient ritual before it\u2019s too late.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Pure stealth and survival.</strong> Move carefully, use distractions, and find shelter if you want to survive. Running without thinking might be your last mistake.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Dark and oppressive environments.</strong> Dim lighting, the sound of your footsteps, and creaking wood will make you question every move. <strong>Are you really alone?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/289c84240068e78f0696a32df8258105.avif?t=1750801146\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/3e6c67cf986a0906c8e14bfb1f79d0c9.poster.avif?t=1750801146\" width=600 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/3e6c67cf986a0906c8e14bfb1f79d0c9.webm?t=1750801146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/3e6c67cf986a0906c8e14bfb1f79d0c9.mp4?t=1750801146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a9 THE LEGEND RETURNS 2025</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/2ee73f7a973bfeb71a30ca0a52630bbf.avif?t=1750801146\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tonight marks the anniversary. The day\u00a0<strong>he</strong>\u00a0returns. The news calls it a myth\u2014a story to scare people into locking their doors. But you don\u2019t believe in urban legends\u2026 until you see him.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts as a normal night out quickly turns into a nightmare. A vagabond warns you:\u00a0<strong>no one walks these streets anymore.</strong>\u00a0A stranger whispers,\u00a0<strong>be careful.</strong>\u00a0Then, from the shadows,\u00a0<strong>he</strong>\u00a0watches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you return home, strange things begin to happen.\u00a0<strong>Footsteps in the dark. A figure outside your window.</strong>\u00a0You\u2019re being hunted, and no one believes you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No one\u2026 except one Strange Person.</strong>\u00a0Together, you search for answers, but the deeper you dig, the worse it gets. An ancient ritual is the only way to stop him. A single weapon\u2014the only thing that can end him for good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you\u00a0<strong>run</strong>,\u00a0<strong>hide</strong>, or\u00a0<strong>fight</strong>? No one escapes the legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/a876b0077d487a8f0cce68ceee84a364.avif?t=1750801146\" width=616 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udd2a <strong>A slasher horror game inspired by PS1 classics.</strong> Immerse yourself in a chilling atmosphere with retro graphics, eerie ambient sounds, and a story that will keep you on edge.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83e\ude78 <strong>Gore-heavy cinematics with brutal encounters.</strong> There\u2019s no easy escape. Every encounter is a fight for survival, with gruesome deaths and intense sequences.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udc40 <strong>A relentless killer who always finds you.</strong> No matter where you hide or how fast you run, <strong>he</strong> is always near, lurking in the shadows.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Perform the ritual\u2026 or become the next victim.</strong> The only way to stop him is to uncover the secrets behind the legend and complete the ancient ritual before it\u2019s too late.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83c\udfc3 <strong>Pure stealth and survival.</strong> Move carefully, use distractions, and find shelter if you want to survive. Running without thinking might be your last mistake.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\ud83d\udd26 <strong>Dark and oppressive environments.</strong> Dim lighting, the sound of your footsteps, and creaking wood will make you question every move. <strong>Are you really alone?</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3569440/extras/289c84240068e78f0696a32df8258105.avif?t=1750801146\" data-has-big width=800 height=800 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
